31:02.920 --> 31:03.400
Betul tak?

31:03.400 --> 31:04.830
Awak fikir-fikirkanlah.

31:04.830 --> 31:06.440
Awak pergi beritahu Pengarah Lu,

31:06.440 --> 31:08.180
